15.steps:
1. Set a IPv4/6 DNS server,in the server,add a FQDN AO and corresponding ip addresses (eg,100 ipv4 addresses and 100 ipv6 ip addresses);
2. Go to NetworkDNS page, enable DNS host name lookup over TCP for FQDN;
3. In DNS page,use the inherited IPv4 DNS server;
4. In DNS Proxy page,enable DNS Proxy,check 'Enforce DNS Proxy For All DNS Requests', add a ipv4/6 split dns entry, set the corresponding domain name and the server;
5. In AO page,add the FQDN AO which is added in the server,capture the packet in FW.

